# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit real values.
# Supabase project settings → API keys. The anon key (now called the publishable
# key, sb_publishable_…) is public by design: row-level security protects data.
# The URL is the bare Project URL, https://<ref>.supabase.co (no /rest/v1).
# For the local database, use the URL and key printed by `pnpm db:start`.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
